//Update Aug 2018
//===============
//  1. Removed support for Codejock versions less than 15.0.1
//  2. Removed { Visibility=Private Obsolete=True } from DAW standard property
//     redirects. If the redirects are in the class then they should not be
//     Obsolete and should be Visible!
//  3. Added redirect for DAW standard property Visible_State
//  4. Focus / CLick bug fixed by changing Click handling to use Wil van
//     Antwerpen's code
//  5. Changed tooltip logic to only setup tooltips if a tooltip is set
//
// Contributions
// =============
//
// When       Who             What
// ========== ============    ==================================================
// 2009-02-28 Tom Murphy      Default size same as VDF button, Hot tracking,
//                            Pointer_Only and code for keyboard & mouse support.
// 2010-08-13 Katrien Naert   Added Tooltip support
// 2010-11-16 Nils G. Svedmyr Update Tooltip support to DAC Standard
// 2018-03-09 Anders Ohrt     Added support for Shadow mixin
//
//==============================================================================

